children.translated_text:
'A river without water is naked; a kingdom without a king is naked;
a widow too is naked, even if she has ten brothers.'
This merit-dedication should not be pronounced thus.

'Those with homes give offerings to those without homes;
  the homeless receive [them], practicing restraint and self-discipline.
  Depending on the wheel of material support, the wheel of <s>Dharma</s> turns.'
